Hi, managers!

We recently tried to remove some harddiscs from our AdvFS file domain using
rmvol. We tried it several times without success. At first it moves files
and some metadata, then it moves the metadata of many files but at the end,
it moves only the metadata of a few files over and over.

At the end, the log goes as follows:

[...]
rmvol: Moving file metadata
    file name: /var/adm/ris/ris0.alpha/product_2/instctrl/DPODOC560.scp
rmvol: Moving file metadata
