Original question:
> Anyone know of any problems with installing the SSH package from 5.1B
> CDs onto 5.1A,pk6? 
> 
> If it's OK, then what patches would I need, if any, to bring the SSH
> package up to date, and where would they be acquired from?

SSH is bundled with 5.1B. It was not bundled with 5.1A.

There is an SSH webkit from HP for Tru64 UNIX 5.1A at:
   http://h30097.www3.hp.com/unix/ssh
HP fully supports this distribution on 5.1A

According to Paul Moore of HP, they :
"do not recommend or support that customers install the SSH kit from
Tru64 UNIX V5.1B on V5.1A system."

